OL,3,AHundreds of thousands without power in
OL,4,AAlabama and Florida after Hurricane
OL,5,AIsaias makes landfall
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of thousands of people have
OL,8,Fbeen left without power in Alabama,
OL,9,FGeorgia and Florida after Hurricane
OL,10,FIsaias made landfall on Friday on the
OL,11,FUS Gulf Coast as a category two storm
OL,13,FA state of emergency has been issued in
OL,14,Fall three states and thousands of
OL,15,Fpeople have been ordered to evacuate
OL,17,FAlthough the centre of the storm has
OL,18,Fmoved away from Florida, Governor Ron
OL,19,FDeSantis says "the threat of flooding
OL,20,Fremains"
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
